# Optional. Only needed to play someone who is NOT on your network.
#
# Without these, Versus still works:
#   - over the LAN, through the relay built into the dev server
#   - between two tabs on one machine, through a BroadcastChannel
#
# With them, a deployed build can pair two players anywhere via Supabase
# Realtime. Create a project at https://supabase.com, enable Realtime, and
# copy the project URL and anon key here as .env.local.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
